Now for the sudoku puzzles: she did 8 of them, each taking 5 minutes. So that's 8 * 5. Let me do that multiplication. 8 * 5 is 40 minutes. Hmm, right. So the total time is 30 minutes for crosswords plus 40 minutes for sudokus. Adding those together: 30 + 40 = 70 minutes.

Wait, let me double-check to make sure I didn't make any mistakes. Let me confirm the numbers again. Crossword time per puzzle: 10 minutes, 3 puzzles: 3*10=30. Sudoku time per puzzle: 5 minutes, 8 puzzles: 8*5=40. Total time: 30+40=70. Yeah, that seems right.

